0_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=maRIbNHqZWQQ7kNvwGOtGpU&_nc_oc=AdqE_LrHoem9D2CnUadF5MYNtduLmWGbxpXRM2HjwuIZydvdqHTkIhcYCRlnm2L_v60&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-IHeUl7xpeXKumso7RlNm6JsSfAjBMO6zSLCQdRJbgPg&oe=6A466B4A"}, {"file_name": "Artboard \u2013 3.png", "id": "1476300653694267", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618512_1476300657027600_2840025129162091773_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mIioXpUGqtIQ7kNvwE5kdv1&_nc_oc=Adp8qyEfMrGBdTSra_avm6LYuxe0q-g2HRBIKIY-n_bnDEt6OGlimUIoEZnDiiPVP9Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-sQYRYUAIOw4H5UGoAV50lW2I-k-YCBnLYmkugIfxMBg&oe=6A4686DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "QuixPlayer", "keywords": ["360VideoPlayer", "180VideoPlayer"], "long_description": "**QuixPlayer - Control 180deg / 360deg Video Playback with QR Codes**\n\nQuixPlayer is a VR video player for Meta Quest 3 and 3S that enables simple, reliable, and fully offline synchronized video playback.\n\nUsing only a QR code, you can start video playback across multiple headsets at the same timing. No internet or local network is required, making it ideal for environments with restricted connectivity.\n\n**Key Features**\n\n**Offline Playback Control**\nScan a QR code to start video playback at a specified timing or condition. QuixPlayer operates entirely offline for stable performance.\n\n**Simple Operation**\nNo complex controller input is needed. Just scan a QR code and the experience begins.\n\n**Playback Modes**\nSYNC: Periodic time sync based on the headset clock (e.g. TRG:SYNC:5).\nREL: Relative countdown after scanning (e.g. TRG:REL:10).\nABS: Absolute time playback (e.g. TRG:ABS:110000).\n\n**QR Code Options**\nQR codes can specify video file name, video type (180deg or 360deg), and layout mode (None, SideBySide, OverUnder, SideBySide3D, OverUnder3D).\n\n**Flexible QR Code Format**\nTRG:{MODE}:{VALUE}?name={file_name}&type={360 or 180}&layout={layout}\n\n**Use Cases**\nSuitable for education, exhibitions, events, and other scenarios where synchronized playback is required without network access.\n\n**Experience**\nShare important moments with your audience at the exact same time using a QR-based playback system.\n", "short_description": "Easily sync and play 180\u00b0/360\u00b0 videos on Meta Quest by simply scanning a QR code."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Artboard \u2013 5.png", "id": "3862485207215612", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618264_3862485213882278_6983363211996585407_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YNC0UNHFtCIQ7kNvwFEK0Vs&_nc_oc=Adpau0UN2MKaSSjMXN_ehF-PF8nVgSVUpIlWerL-ke9An0IqV3GrJYYmk1xKgFPnEV4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_8R2Ru7ocluU_UmU32qhSM2V6OEOALPXeNR1eIeEXA0A&oe=6A4661AE"}, {"file_name": "432px \u2013 f \u2013 1.png", "id": "1135616805161792", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619148_1135616808495125_8615746792926765700_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BA6tcD-sj-wQ7kNvwEV68e8&_nc_oc=AdoqD-SNOfx0eOKNjdZt2Zo1ynSsZgg9wuVoWlW5n3kBe2yoHtbIqIqdh1v5odVQE78&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-T7KKTz61gLq82viNlEiwjsiHDXKPe1qnZl-ffoc-wwg&oe=6A466DF1"}, {"file_name": "Artboard \u2013 6.png", "id": "814564234364013", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618274_814564237697346_1085994346422534066_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JQKqDB7axKAQ7kNvwHCGoDV&_nc_oc=AdqkvcFExyK5d0C0mH5nJuQ8cPiNXKgOhP8QKMW0It0l5cmr4KC4bxnOK1Q8aB_0e_o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_W8Z0wiYh2Ir63iaZJ6052Zu_BSGvCvRAlLSNtUZ1d7A&oe=6A467FF3"}, {"file_name": "Artboard \u2013 2.png", "id": "789635813